| Previous Approach | New Approach |
|------------------|--------------|
| Simple t-test only | Full multivariate logistic regression with confounders |
| No visualization attempts | Interactive, facetted, stratified visualizations |
| Confounders ignored | All major confounders included and interpreted |
| Assumed linear relationship | Tests for non-linearity and interactions |
| No subgroup analysis | Explores heterogeneity by sex, race, education |
